                                "sense_id": "656dcb08-eaa9-35f7-a62e-2a3f11f45ade",
                                "text": "Let your lingua loiter on its salty, hard surface. When you finally crack the nut, don’t swallow it right away."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ed76bbf-a729-43ae-b424-4584b587356d",
                                "sense_id": "656dcb08-eaa9-35f7-a62e-2a3f11f45ade",
                                "text": "“I believe it’s from the condition he’s acquired,” she answered while moving closer to examine the elongated lingua. “You can put it back in your mouth now.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
